  \{\
    id: "NI01",\
    text: "Khi m\uc0\u7897 t v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  c\'f3 r\u7845 t nhi\u7873 u th\'f4ng tin r\u7901 i r\u7841 c, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng c\u7889  t\'ecm ra m\u7897 t \'fd t\u432 \u7903 ng ho\u7863 c pattern chung n\u7857 m ph\'eda sau ch\'fang.",\
