    text: "T\'f4i th\uc0\u432 \u7901 ng suy ngh\u297  v\u7873  vi\u7879 c m\u7897 t s\u7921  vi\u7879 c hi\u7879 n t\u7841 i c\'f3 th\u7875  d\u7851 n \u273 \u7871 n \u273 i\u7873 u g\'ec trong t\u432 \u417 ng lai.",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NI03",\
    text: "\uc0\u272 \'f4i khi t\'f4i c\'f3 m\u7897 t c\u7843 m gi\'e1c kh\'e1 r\'f5 v\u7873  h\u432 \u7899 ng m\'e0 m\u7897 t v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  \u273 ang \u273 i \u273 \u7871 n, d\'f9 ch\u432 a th\u7875  gi\u7843 i th\'edch ngay b\u7857 ng t\u7915 ng b\u432 \u7899 c c\u7909  th\u7875 .",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NI04",\
    text: "T\'f4i th\'edch \uc0\u273 \'e0o s\'e2u m\u7897 t \'fd t\u432 \u7903 ng cho \u273 \u7871 n khi hi\u7875 u \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \'fd ngh\u297 a ho\u7863 c nguy\'ean l\'fd c\u7889 t l\'f5i c\u7911 a n\'f3.",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NI05",\
    text: "Khi m\uc0\u7897 t v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  ch\u432 a c\'f3 \u273 \u7911  d\u7919  ki\u7879 n, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng kh\'f4ng mu\u7889 n h\'ecnh th\'e0nh m\u7897 t b\u7913 c tranh t\u7893 ng th\u7875  v\'e0 th\'edch ch\u7881  nh\'ecn t\u7915 ng th\'f4ng tin ri\'eang l\u7867 .",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: true,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NI06",\
    text: "T\'f4i hi\uc0\u7871 m khi li\'ean h\u7879  m\u7897 t s\u7921  ki\u7879 n hi\u7879 n t\u7841 i v\u7899 i nh\u7919 ng xu h\u432 \u7899 ng ho\u7863 c \'fd ngh\u297 a xa h\u417 n c\u7911 a n\'f3.",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: true,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NI07",\
    text: "Khi nghe m\uc0\u7897 t ng\u432 \u7901 i b\u7841 n k\u7875  nhi\u7873 u chuy\u7879 n nh\u7887  x\u7843 y ra g\u7847 n \u273 \'e2y, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng mu\u7889 n hi\u7875 u xem t\u7845 t c\u7843  nh\u7919 ng chuy\u7879 n \u273 \'f3 \u273 ang ch\u7881  v\u7873  v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  ho\u7863 c xu h\u432 \u7899 ng n\'e0o.",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NI08",\
    text: "Khi xem m\uc0\u7897 t b\u7897  phim ho\u7863 c \u273 \u7885 c m\u7897 t c\'e2u chuy\u7879 n, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng ch\'fa \'fd \u273 \u7871 n th\'f4ng \u273 i\u7879 p ho\u7863 c \'fd ngh\u297 a \u7849 n ph\'eda sau c\'e1c s\u7921  ki\u7879 n h\u417 n l\'e0 ch\u7881  nh\u7899  t\u7915 ng chi ti\u7871 t.",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NI09",\
    text: "Khi nhi\uc0\u7873 u s\u7921  vi\u7879 c li\'ean ti\u7871 p x\u7843 y ra, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng xem ch\'fang l\'e0 nh\u7919 ng chuy\u7879 n ri\'eang bi\u7879 t v\'e0 \'edt t\'ecm m\u7897 t ch\u7911  \u273 \u7873  chung k\u7871 t n\u7889 i ch\'fang.",\
    function: "Ni",\
    reverse: true,\
  \},\
