  \{\
    id: "NE01",\
    text: "M\uc0\u7897 t \'fd t\u432 \u7903 ng th\u432 \u7901 ng khi\u7871 n t\'f4i ngh\u297  ngay \u273 \u7871 n nhi\u7873 u \'fd t\u432 \u7903 ng kh\'e1c c\'f3 th\u7875  ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n t\u7915  n\'f3.",\
