    text: "Khi g\uc0\u7863 p m\u7897 t v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873 , t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng th\'edch ngh\u297  ra nhi\u7873 u c\'e1ch gi\u7843 i th\'edch thay v\'ec nhanh ch\'f3ng ch\u7885 n m\u7897 t c\'e1ch duy nh\u7845 t.",\
