    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NE03",\
    text: "T\'f4i d\uc0\u7877  b\u7883  thu h\'fat b\u7903 i nh\u7919 ng kh\u7843  n\u259 ng m\u7899 i, k\u7875  c\u7843  khi ch\'fang ch\u432 a c\'f3 k\u7871  ho\u7841 ch r\'f5 r\'e0ng.",\
    function: "Ne",\
    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NE04",\
    text: "Khi nghe m\uc0\u7897 t kh\'e1i ni\u7879 m m\u7899 i, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng li\'ean h\u7879  n\'f3 v\u7899 i nh\u7919 ng l\u297 nh v\u7921 c ho\u7863 c \'fd t\u432 \u7903 ng t\u432 \u7903 ng nh\u432  kh\'f4ng li\'ean quan.",\
    function: "Ne",\
    reverse: false,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NE05",\
    text: "T\'f4i th\uc0\u432 \u7901 ng c\u7843 m th\u7845 y c\'f3 qu\'e1 nhi\u7873 u kh\u7843  n\u259 ng m\u7899 i khi\u7871 n vi\u7879 c suy ngh\u297  th\'eam tr\u7903  n\'ean kh\'f4ng c\u7847 n thi\u7871 t.",\
    function: "Ne",\
    reverse: true,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NE06",\
    text: "Khi \uc0\u273 \'e3 t\'ecm \u273 \u432 \u7907 c m\u7897 t c\'e1ch gi\u7843 i th\'edch h\u7907 p l\'fd, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng kh\'f4ng th\u7845 y c\u7847 n ph\u7843 i kh\'e1m ph\'e1 th\'eam nh\u7919 ng kh\u7843  n\u259 ng kh\'e1c.",\
    function: "Ne",\
    reverse: true,\
  \},\
  \{\
    id: "NE07",\
    text: "Trong m\uc0\u7897 t cu\u7897 c tr\'f2 chuy\u7879 n, m\u7897 t \'fd t\u432 \u7903 ng nh\u7887  c\'f3 th\u7875  khi\u7871 n t\'f4i li\'ean t\u432 \u7903 ng ngay \u273 \u7871 n nhi\u7873 u ch\u7911  \u273 \u7873  ho\u7863 c kh\u7843  n\u259 ng kh\'e1c.",\
