    text: "Khi l\'ean k\uc0\u7871  ho\u7841 ch cho m\u7897 t chuy\u7871 n \u273 i cu\u7889 i tu\u7847 n, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng th\'edch ngh\u297  ra nhi\u7873 u \u273 \u7883 a \u273 i\u7875 m ho\u7863 c c\'e1ch tr\u7843 i nghi\u7879 m kh\'e1c nhau tr\u432 \u7899 c khi quy\u7871 t \u273 \u7883 nh.",\
