  \{\
    id: "SI01",\
    text: "Khi \uc0\u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 m\u7897 t t\'ecnh hu\u7889 ng, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng nh\u7899  l\u7841 i nh\u7919 ng tr\u7843 i nghi\u7879 m tr\u432 \u7899 c \u273 \'e2y \u273 \u7875  xem n\'f3 c\'f3 \u273 i\u7875 m g\'ec t\u432 \u417 ng \u273 \u7891 ng ho\u7863 c kh\'e1c bi\u7879 t.",\
