    text: "T\'f4i th\'edch x\'e2y d\uc0\u7921 ng hi\u7875 u bi\u7871 t d\u7921 a tr\'ean nh\u7919 ng g\'ec m\'ecnh \u273 \'e3 tr\u7921 c ti\u7871 p tr\u7843 i qua ho\u7863 c \u273 \'e3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ki\u7875 m ch\u7913 ng.",\
