  \{\
    id: "SI07",\
    text: "Khi l\'e0m l\uc0\u7841 i m\u7897 t m\'f3n \u259 n ho\u7863 c m\u7897 t vi\u7879 c quen thu\u7897 c, t\'f4i th\u432 \u7901 ng nh\u7899  nh\u7919 ng \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh nh\u7887  t\u7915  nh\u7919 ng l\u7847 n tr\u432 \u7899 c v\'e0 \'e1p d\u7909 ng l\u7841 i ch\'fang.",\
